WEBVTT

01:27.140 --> 01:29.980
<b>AQUARION</b>

01:37.510 --> 01:38.910
Where are we?

01:41.240 --> 01:43.910
<i>Could this be mythic space?</i>

01:43.910 --> 01:44.920
Look!

01:45.470 --> 01:46.250
<i>The rift!</i>

01:49.750 --> 01:51.120
Here it comes!

01:56.140 --> 01:58.370
Sakko, don't be afraid!

01:58.760 --> 01:59.650
Huh?

02:26.060 --> 02:27.490
Where am I?

02:38.550 --> 02:40.200
Oh...

02:45.490 --> 02:46.740
What?

02:49.050 --> 02:51.950
I've got to look for Sakko.

03:10.040 --> 03:11.240
It's a flesh.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.890
Oh, it's a flesh.

03:15.920 --> 03:18.320
Are you after my body or something?

03:18.580 --> 03:20.630
Unite with me.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.630
Cannot enter.

03:23.630 --> 03:25.430
Must already be filled.

03:27.190 --> 03:29.960
What a shame. It's such a nice flesh.

03:43.780 --> 03:44.950
Sakko!

03:46.300 --> 03:47.160
Uh...

03:48.070 --> 03:52.030
Momohime, I'm really glad you're okay.

03:52.030 --> 03:53.300
Sakko?

03:54.670 --> 03:57.150
When I woke up, I'd been ejected.

03:57.150 --> 04:00.630
I wanted to search for you two, 
but was too af—

04:00.940 --> 04:02.030
Huh?

04:03.530 --> 04:04.550
I was too afraid.

04:04.550 --> 04:05.670
Huh?

04:05.670 --> 04:10.400
Ever since we entered this universe, 
I've been filled with this emotion.

04:11.220 --> 04:15.190
It's probably the reason we broke union, too.

04:15.780 --> 04:17.110
So that's it.

04:17.510 --> 04:22.270
When we achieved emotional balance, 
our mana values must have dropped.

04:23.370 --> 04:24.950
Sakko, what are those?

04:28.070 --> 04:29.530
What the hell are these?

04:29.530 --> 04:32.770
They might be your fear, Sakko.

04:32.770 --> 04:34.860
What? Th-These things?

04:39.480 --> 04:41.170
Momohime, is that...

04:43.630 --> 04:44.730
It's okay.

04:45.320 --> 04:46.920
I'll protect you.

04:47.330 --> 04:49.000
H-Hey!

04:52.710 --> 04:55.980
Anyway, we should look for Rimiya.

04:56.270 --> 04:57.980
Uh... yeah.

05:01.650 --> 05:05.440
<i>This must mean Momohime 
is able to feel love now.</i>

05:06.550 --> 05:09.690
It's like this whole world is in ruins.

05:09.690 --> 05:10.890
Yeah.

05:10.890 --> 05:13.340
Where are all the people, though?

05:13.340 --> 05:16.340
You mean the Shadow Angels? Who knows?

05:16.340 --> 05:17.390
Whoa!

05:17.390 --> 05:18.270
Huh?

05:20.880 --> 05:22.700
They're just masks.

05:23.400 --> 05:24.950
O-Oh.

05:26.130 --> 05:27.530
What's your problem?

05:27.530 --> 05:29.770
You're kinda cute when you're scared.

05:29.770 --> 05:32.480
No, I was just surprised! That's all!

05:35.090 --> 05:38.860
Or is this what fear feels like? 
I still don't really get it.

05:40.610 --> 05:42.850
Creatures of the flesh universe.

05:44.520 --> 05:47.470
Why do you kill?

05:48.790 --> 05:51.590
When you do not even love us?

05:51.590 --> 05:52.580
Huh?

05:53.240 --> 05:55.530
Killing is a sin.

05:55.530 --> 05:59.540
The goddess will not allow it. 
You do not even do it out of love.

05:59.540 --> 06:02.170
Sun said something like that, too.

06:02.170 --> 06:03.740
Sun-kun did?

06:03.740 --> 06:08.790
So you guys are the Shadow Angels? 
You kill people in our world, too!

06:09.100 --> 06:13.790
But we do have love for the flesh universe.

06:13.790 --> 06:18.180
The flesh universe... You mean our universe?

06:18.180 --> 06:21.910
We exist as nothing more than thoughtforms.

06:22.350 --> 06:26.310
We love the flesh, 
as we have none ourselves.

06:26.640 --> 06:33.820
We are only using these masks as a temporary 
embodiment in order to speak to you.

06:34.800 --> 06:37.520
You're the things that just 
tried to enter my body!

06:37.520 --> 06:39.820
I was attacked, too! By those slimy things.

06:39.820 --> 06:43.250
We only wanted to unite with you both.

06:43.250 --> 06:45.180
What kind of excuse is that?

06:45.180 --> 06:49.530
If you want to unite, is that why you're 
trying to unite our universes, too?

06:50.110 --> 06:56.510
Unity is the will of the child of the 
holy egg. We are merely obeying that.

06:56.840 --> 07:00.080
The child of the holy egg... 
Do you mean Sun?

07:00.080 --> 07:01.140
But why would he want that?

07:01.450 --> 07:04.630
If you are thoughtforms that 
are only made up of emotions,

07:04.630 --> 07:06.650
then what are the Mythic Beasts?

07:07.190 --> 07:11.660
Beasts created by the goddess. 
Vessels for emotion.

07:12.240 --> 07:19.400
Only select Element warriors among us 
are able to unite with those beasts.

07:19.800 --> 07:24.370
With that borrowed flesh, 
they are able to fight against you.

07:24.900 --> 07:26.410
That is a warrior.

07:26.750 --> 07:28.670
Element warriors?

07:29.720 --> 07:32.490
That's basically the same as us.

07:34.120 --> 07:38.760
We're looking for our friend. 
Do you know where he is?

07:39.540 --> 07:44.280
The being that came from the flesh 
universe is inside the goddess's womb.

07:44.730 --> 07:46.510
The goddess's womb?

07:47.950 --> 07:49.380
Up there?

07:54.330 --> 07:55.790
Thank you.

07:55.790 --> 07:57.610
Sakko, let's go.

07:57.610 --> 07:58.380
Yeah.

08:06.220 --> 08:07.370
It's so high up!

08:07.730 --> 08:09.380
Here, Sakko.

08:09.380 --> 08:10.780
I'm good.

08:10.780 --> 08:12.920
Oh, quit acting tough!

08:27.320 --> 08:29.590
What is this place?

08:35.770 --> 08:39.570
Are these... wings?

08:42.630 --> 08:45.210
Sakko, look! They're becoming wings!

08:45.210 --> 08:46.130
Huh?!

08:48.240 --> 08:51.420
Wh-What's going on? I have them, too?

08:51.700 --> 08:52.800
Yeah.

08:52.800 --> 08:57.940
Actually, you had some of that slimy stuff 
on you. It must have turned into wings.

08:57.940 --> 09:02.520
Really? Okay. Then are my emotions...

09:03.110 --> 09:05.430
I hope this doesn't mean

09:05.430 --> 09:08.570
we turn into people from this universe 
when the wings finish growing.

09:08.570 --> 09:10.380
Don't say that! You're scaring me.

09:11.750 --> 09:13.010
But...

09:13.010 --> 09:14.030
Huh?

09:16.370 --> 09:18.190
Come on, let's keep going.

09:18.190 --> 09:19.750
O-Okay.

09:31.800 --> 09:33.940
Is that Japan?

09:35.400 --> 09:37.960
Looks like Enoshima, doesn't it?

09:38.600 --> 09:42.470
So that's the triangle 
the three stakes made?

09:43.070 --> 09:46.390
And it's shining light onto this side.

09:47.010 --> 09:49.350
It is recovering mana.

09:51.010 --> 09:54.140
That light is from mana? 
What do you mean recovering?

09:54.480 --> 09:58.500
You are stealing the mana from this universe

09:58.500 --> 10:00.910
using the false goddess's stakes.

10:02.060 --> 10:04.870
False goddess's stakes? You don't mean...

10:04.870 --> 10:05.840
DEAVA?

10:14.260 --> 10:15.450
Sister?

10:20.850 --> 10:24.590
Would ya like to take a listen 
to the song of the wingless?

10:24.940 --> 10:27.170
Song of the... wingless?

10:27.170 --> 10:30.570
Specimens of humans that were 
brought here from outside Naacal.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.560
Sukuna!

10:52.270 --> 10:55.510
If only those children had wings.

11:03.800 --> 11:07.050
Are Momohime-senpai and the others 
gonna be able to come back?

11:07.050 --> 11:11.560
They are trying to bring Aquarion back. 
It's too important for battle.

11:11.560 --> 11:14.720
Toshi-senpai, you're sure actin' different.

11:15.320 --> 11:17.290
I'm the same as I've ever been.

11:18.980 --> 11:20.200
Hana-chan.

11:24.700 --> 11:27.440
The world is made of vibrating strings.

11:27.960 --> 11:33.410
That's why, when emotions resonate, 
they transmit mana.

11:38.590 --> 11:42.660
Hey, Momo-chan. Do you like Sakko?

11:42.660 --> 11:45.580
Yeah! I really like Sakko!

11:46.090 --> 11:47.730
I like you too, Sayo!

11:48.360 --> 11:50.240
I knew you'd say that.

11:51.910 --> 11:55.600
Sakko likes you too, you know.

11:56.080 --> 11:58.580
Huh? How do you know?

11:59.040 --> 12:03.210
I can sense strong feelings, 
even when I don't understand them.

12:03.840 --> 12:08.100
Sakko's sure gonna be happy 
when this little guy is done.

12:08.540 --> 12:10.290
You'll be happy too, right?

12:10.290 --> 12:11.000
Mm-hmm.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.120
And so will I!

12:17.890 --> 12:19.720
What's wrong, Momohime?

12:21.130 --> 12:24.310
I was just thinking about Sayo.

12:24.310 --> 12:25.310
Oh.

12:26.390 --> 12:29.950
Sayo acted kind of motherly sometimes.

12:29.950 --> 12:31.180
Yeah, she did.

12:31.940 --> 12:34.990
I never knew who my real mother was,

12:35.270 --> 12:39.980
but the people who raised me 
would always call me a failure.

12:40.510 --> 12:42.770
I think it was the same for all of us.

12:44.210 --> 12:48.670
I always thought that you 
had a crush on Sayo.

12:48.070 --> 12:49.990
H-Huh?

12:49.990 --> 12:53.460
I always thought of her like, 
well, I don't know...

12:55.270 --> 13:00.760
Sakko, listen. 
Right now I feel something for you.

13:03.140 --> 13:04.380
Sayo!

13:04.380 --> 13:05.380
Why are you here?

13:07.890 --> 13:09.770
Wait, Sayo!

13:11.180 --> 13:12.200
Sayo!

13:15.400 --> 13:18.160
What? Where did she go?

13:21.010 --> 13:23.580
I know where we are.

13:24.490 --> 13:25.820
So do I.

13:30.440 --> 13:34.130
Promise. Universe. Union.

13:34.130 --> 13:39.170
Proof of vows. A seal. A reunion.

13:39.660 --> 13:45.270
Birth. The holy egg. Twelve thousand years.

13:51.810 --> 13:54.600
Was that the goddess?

13:58.070 --> 14:00.440
A reunion?

14:02.260 --> 14:04.240
Proof of vows?

14:15.980 --> 14:18.220
Twelve thousand years.

14:23.080 --> 14:26.580
I am sure that some day, 
we will meet here again.

14:31.860 --> 14:34.410
I think we buried something.

14:57.430 --> 14:58.320
Let's go!

14:58.320 --> 14:58.910
Yeah.

15:12.780 --> 15:14.230
Sayo?

15:19.070 --> 15:20.440
The Mythic Beast!

15:22.650 --> 15:24.220
It's absorbing them!

15:29.280 --> 15:30.640
It's Vector Tir!

15:32.920 --> 15:33.900
Rimiya!

15:38.170 --> 15:40.960
<i>Rimiya! Rimiya! Can you hear me?</i>

15:41.460 --> 15:43.050
Momohime-neesama?

15:43.660 --> 15:45.090
Are you okay, Rimiya?

15:45.090 --> 15:48.450
Sakko? But how?

15:48.450 --> 15:50.540
<i>We can communicate with our wings.</i>

15:50.540 --> 15:51.580
Wings?

15:53.000 --> 15:54.990
Are these mine?

15:56.370 --> 15:58.480
Rimiya, you've got get Tir moving!

15:58.480 --> 16:00.860
If you don't, it's gonna get 
sucked into that huge thing!

16:00.860 --> 16:04.610
Huh? Uh, yeah. But how do I...

16:04.610 --> 16:05.970
Hurry up, Rimiya!

16:06.470 --> 16:09.630
Space, union, annihilation.

16:11.580 --> 16:14.030
It's you. Churo.

16:14.420 --> 16:18.030
My name is Churoku. The warrior Element.

16:18.030 --> 16:22.630
That's what Sayo said. She said it 
was the name of a mythical warrior.

16:22.630 --> 16:27.540
I've taken the form of something 
that was precious to both of you.

16:27.910 --> 16:30.250
I will borrow this body to speak to you.

16:30.610 --> 16:36.050
I wish to love you, fight you, and unite.

16:36.290 --> 16:39.220
Doesn't that mean one side 
or the other will disappear?

16:39.400 --> 16:44.720
All living creatures eventually disappear, 
but the light of mana is eternal.

16:45.190 --> 16:47.480
So you need not worry.

16:47.910 --> 16:52.790
I still don't get it. 
How can you fight something you love?

16:53.540 --> 16:56.470
<i>I think I kind of understand how it feels.</i>

16:56.470 --> 16:59.090
Huh? Rimiya?

16:59.090 --> 17:03.160
So this is what it means to 
understand someone's feelings!

17:03.740 --> 17:07.350
When you like someone, you want 
to absorb them completely.

17:07.350 --> 17:09.250
Is it something like that?

17:11.200 --> 17:13.810
That is the blessing of the goddess.

17:14.250 --> 17:16.320
What are you talking about?

17:16.320 --> 17:20.010
What goddess? Where is she? 
I want to talk to her!

17:20.010 --> 17:22.150
The goddess was torn apart.

17:22.150 --> 17:24.620
She is now omnipresent.

17:24.620 --> 17:25.620
Huh?

17:26.580 --> 17:31.520
When universes unite, 
the goddess will reappear.

17:31.810 --> 17:34.880
It is the will of the child of the holy egg.

17:37.020 --> 17:42.300
Now, let us fight to our hearts' 
content and then unite!

17:55.600 --> 17:56.310
Rimiya!

17:56.310 --> 17:58.300
<i>I'm okay, Sister.</i>

17:58.590 --> 17:59.710
Let's get on board!

18:07.430 --> 18:08.990
We're going home together!

18:08.990 --> 18:10.480
But how?

18:10.780 --> 18:11.970
I don't know.

18:12.760 --> 18:15.320
Let's start flying toward Enoshima!

18:27.120 --> 18:29.000
Sakko! Unite!

18:29.330 --> 18:31.870
Should we try? Let's unite!

18:34.460 --> 18:35.630
<i>Our mana values are too low.</i>

18:36.780 --> 18:38.120
This isn't gonna work.

18:39.540 --> 18:44.350
<i>I will throw away my fear and 
fight against the goddess!</i>

18:47.770 --> 18:51.120
If these wings are the problem, 
we should get rid of them.

18:51.590 --> 18:53.570
Guys, rip out your wings!

18:53.570 --> 18:55.070
Huh? The wings?

18:55.280 --> 19:00.300
We have to return our emotional balance 
to normal, like it was in our universe.

19:00.300 --> 19:01.330
But then...

19:01.730 --> 19:05.740
If we get rid of our wings, 
we'll lose our emotions all over again.

19:06.750 --> 19:08.570
I guess it can't be helped.

19:08.570 --> 19:14.860
Still, I don't want to lose my emotions now 
that I can understand everyone's feelings!

19:14.860 --> 19:18.920
<i>Neither do I. But we don't have a choice!</i>

19:18.920 --> 19:20.750
Don't worry, Rimiya.

19:21.170 --> 19:24.430
We know that you can understand people's 
feelings better than anyone now.

19:24.860 --> 19:27.190
<i>And we won't forget it after we're back.</i>

19:27.190 --> 19:28.180
<i>Yeah!</i>

19:28.640 --> 19:32.030
You're both sure you're okay with this?

19:38.010 --> 19:41.490
All right, then. I'll remember, too.

19:41.850 --> 19:44.480
<i>That Sakko is the biggest scaredy-cat ever,</i>

19:44.830 --> 19:50.340
and that Momohime-neesama has a pure heart 
that can love stronger than anyone.

19:54.460 --> 19:56.340
Sakko, Rimiya,

19:57.010 --> 19:58.500
let's unite!

20:10.590 --> 20:14.360
Mythic Star Union! Go, Aquarion!

20:37.540 --> 20:41.040
<i>Now you are a true warrior.</i>

20:47.040 --> 20:50.190
<i>Oh, such love. Such delight!</i>

21:00.490 --> 21:03.290
Damn it! How are we gonna get back?!

21:03.290 --> 21:05.680
If we can't open the rift, 
there's nothing we can do!

21:05.680 --> 21:09.170
I can sense strong feelings, 
even when I don't understand them.

21:09.440 --> 21:13.160
Guys, we have to wish 
really hard to go home!

21:17.780 --> 21:20.050
Sakko, it's beyond that light!

21:20.050 --> 21:21.510
The rift opened up!

21:21.510 --> 21:22.050
Yeah!

21:25.040 --> 21:29.260
Go!

21:45.930 --> 21:46.770
Churo!

21:49.510 --> 21:50.540
Churo...

22:01.220 --> 22:04.370
What is that black thing?

22:05.210 --> 22:07.320
<i>So you've all returned,</i>

22:07.880 --> 22:09.170
<i>I see.</i>
